# Stack catalog (condensed)

**Disk-priority dependency isolation:** Python uses one machine-level `uv` executable, one shared cache, and hardlinked repo-root `.venv` environments. Keep cache and repos on the same filesystem, use system Python, and run `uv cache prune` periodically.

**Windows default:** prefer **Word and PowerPoint via COM** (`win32com`) for review-grade Office deliverables. Use `python-docx` / `python-pptx` as **fallback** only (no Office, headless CI, read-only parse, explicit user opt-in).

| Stack | Packages | Used in | Rule |
|-------|----------|---------|------|
| Python environments | `uv` | All Python repos | Shared cache + `--link-mode hardlink`; no duplicate managed Python |
| Office DOCX (preferred) | `pywin32` + Word | ORSI, campania_transplant | Default for generating/editing `.docx` |
| Office PPTX (preferred) | `pywin32` + PowerPoint | ORSI metrics decks | Template-based COM decks |
| Office DOC (legacy) | Word COM | ORSI LAR | `.doc` → `.docx` via `SaveAs2(..., 16)` |
| Office DOCX (fallback) | `python-docx` | ORSI, campania_transplant | Parse or when Word unavailable |
| Office PPTX (fallback) | `python-pptx` | ORSI | Read-only or trivial slides only |
| Document read → Markdown | `markitdown[all]` via `uv` in repo `.venv` | All repos | Convert before Read on Office/PDF; not for authoring |
| MATLAB research | MATLAB R20xx+ | AR_pipeline | `ar_*` naming; `matlab -batch` |
| Sim teleop GUI | PySide6, pygame, pytest | PS_robot_adaptor | Simulation-only |
| Streamlit + charts | streamlit, matplotlib, numpy | campania_transplant | Dashboard + figures |
| PHP + MySQL | PHP 8.2+, PDO, MySQL 8 | kidney_federico, Xenios_FInances | Prepared statements, CSRF |
| Python + MySQL | mysql-connector-python, pandas | kidney_federico | Parameterized SQL; env config |
| Python numerics | numpy, scipy, pandas, matplotlib | Research repos | Use project pins |
| R statistics | tidyverse, survival, lme4, renv | Any `.R` repo | No raw PHI in commits |
| Next.js medical site | Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, Zod, Vitest, Playwright e2e | X_booking (`dev01`) | `ACTIVE_CLIENT` config; Google iframe booking; not WordPress |
| Playwright Python scrape | playwright, bs4, openpyxl, tqdm | X_booking (`scraping`) | Two-phase discover→enrich; `scrape.json` checkpoint; `atomic_io`; resume launchers; no committed contact data |
| Terminal progress | tqdm | All long Python jobs | Required; `05-tqdm-progress.mdc` |
| Orchestrator startup pipeline | tqdm, colorama | auto_learning_agent | Progress bars plus colorized clean/dirty/blocked repository status; repo-local `.venv` only |

## Office COM essentials

- `pywin32>=306`; Word/PowerPoint installed locally for production builds.
- `Visible = False`, `DisplayAlerts = 0` on Word; `Quit()` in `finally`.
- Handle `PermissionError` on locked deliverables; kill orphan `POWERPNT.EXE` / `WINWORD.EXE` after failed runs.
- Edit `source/` or builders — not hand-tweak `deliverables/` unless one-off.

